---
// 根目錄重定向頁面 - 移植相鄰專案的強化語言偵測（無語言選擇 UI，失敗時 fallback 到 en）
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SeaSalt.ai - AI-Powered Contact Center Solutions</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Transform your customer communications with SeaSalt.ai's AI-powered omnichannel platform. Unify WhatsApp, SMS, voice calls, and chat in one intelligent solution.">
    
    <!-- Canonical URL -->
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://seasalt.ai/en/">
    
    <!-- 預加載最可能的語言頁面 -->
    <link rel="preload" href="/en/" as="document">
    
    <!-- Hreflang 標籤 -->
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://seasalt.ai/en/">
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="zh-TW" href="https://seasalt.ai/zh-TW/">
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="zh-CN" href="https://seasalt.ai/zh-CN/">
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="ja" href="https://seasalt.ai/ja/">
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="ko" href="https://seasalt.ai/ko/">
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="es" href="https://seasalt.ai/es/">
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="fr" href="https://seasalt.ai/fr/">
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="de" href="https://seasalt.ai/de/">
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://seasalt.ai/en/">
    
    <!-- 強化語言偵測與任意路徑重導向（支援 sessionStorage redirectPath/spa_redirect） -->
    <script>
        (function() {
            // 支援的語言列表（需與 astro.config.mjs 同步）
            const supportedLocales = [
                'en', 'es', 'zh-TW', 'zh-CN', 'ja', 'ko', 'fr', 'de', 'ar', 'fa',
                'fil', 'hi', 'id', 'ms', 'pl', 'pt', 'ru', 'ta', 'th', 'vi', 'ro'
            ];

            // 語言映射表（瀏覽器/地區變體 → 專案語言碼）
            const languageMap = {
                'zh-Hans': 'zh-CN',
                'zh-Hant': 'zh-TW',
                'zh-HK': 'zh-TW',
                'zh-MO': 'zh-TW',
                'zh-SG': 'zh-CN',
                'zh': 'zh-TW',
                'fil-PH': 'fil',
                'tl': 'fil',
                'fa-IR': 'fa',
                'ms-MY': 'ms',
                'ta-IN': 'ta',
                'hi-IN': 'hi',
                'id-ID': 'id',
                'th-TH': 'th',
                'vi-VN': 'vi'
            };

            // 時區 → 語言推測（簡化版）
            const timezoneToLanguage = {
                'Asia/Tokyo': 'ja',
                'Asia/Seoul': 'ko',
                'Asia/Shanghai': 'zh-CN',
                'Asia/Hong_Kong': 'zh-TW',
                'Asia/Taipei': 'zh-TW',
                'Asia/Singapore': 'zh-CN',
                'Asia/Bangkok': 'th',
                'Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh': 'vi',
                'Asia/Jakarta': 'id',
                'Asia/Kuala_Lumpur': 'ms',
                'Asia/Manila': 'fil',
                'Asia/Kolkata': 'hi',
                'Asia/Karachi': 'hi',
                'Asia/Tehran': 'fa',
                'Asia/Dubai': 'ar',
                'Asia/Riyadh': 'ar',
                'Europe/London': 'en',
                'Europe/Berlin': 'de',
                'Europe/Paris': 'fr',
                'Europe/Madrid': 'es',
                'Europe/Rome': 'es',
                'Europe/Warsaw': 'pl',
                'Europe/Moscow': 'ru',
                'America/New_York': 'en',
                'America/Los_Angeles': 'en',
                'America/Chicago': 'en',
                'America/Toronto': 'en',
                'America/Mexico_City': 'es',
                'America/Sao_Paulo': 'pt',
                'Australia/Sydney': 'en',
                'Africa/Cairo': 'ar'
            };

            function isSupportedLocale(code) {
                return supportedLocales.includes(code);
            }

            function detectLanguage() {
                const urlParams = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
                const debug = urlParams.get('debug') === '1';
                const log = [];

                // 1) URL 參數
                const urlLang = urlParams.get('lang');
                if (urlLang && isSupportedLocale(urlLang)) {
                    log.push(`URL param: ${urlLang}`);
                    debug && console.log(log.join('\n'));
                    return urlLang;
                }

                // 2) localStorage 偏好
                try {
                    const savedLang = localStorage.getItem('seasalt-preferred-language');
                    if (savedLang && isSupportedLocale(savedLang)) {
                        log.push(`Saved preference: ${savedLang}`);
                        debug && console.log(log.join('\n'));
                        return savedLang;
                    }
                } catch {}

                // 3) 瀏覽器語言清單
                const browserLangs = navigator.languages || [navigator.language || navigator.userLanguage];
                for (const browserLang of browserLangs) {
                    const normalized = String(browserLang || '').trim();
                    const lower = normalized.toLowerCase();

                    if (isSupportedLocale(lower)) {
                        log.push(`Browser direct: ${lower}`);
                        debug && console.log(log.join('\n'));
                        return lower;
                    }
                    if (languageMap[normalized]) {
                        const mapped = languageMap[normalized];
                        if (isSupportedLocale(mapped)) {
                            log.push(`Browser mapped: ${normalized} → ${mapped}`);
                            debug && console.log(log.join('\n'));
                            return mapped;
                        }
                    }
                    const prefix = lower.split('-')[0];
                    if (isSupportedLocale(prefix)) {
                        log.push(`Browser prefix: ${lower} → ${prefix}`);
                        debug && console.log(log.join('\n'));
                        return prefix;
                    }
                    if (prefix === 'zh') {
                        const zh = (lower.includes('cn') || lower.includes('hans')) ? 'zh-CN' : 'zh-TW';
                        log.push(`Browser zh variant: ${lower} → ${zh}`);
                        debug && console.log(log.join('\n'));
                        return zh;
                    }
                }

                // 4) 時區推測
                try {
                    const tz = Intl.DateTimeFormat().resolvedOptions().timeZone;
                    const tzLang = timezoneToLanguage[tz];
                    if (tzLang && isSupportedLocale(tzLang)) {
                        log.push(`Timezone: ${tz} → ${tzLang}`);
                        debug && console.log(log.join('\n'));
                        return tzLang;
                    }
                } catch {}

                // 5) 預設英文
                log.push('Fallback: en');
                debug && console.log(log.join('\n'));
                return 'en';
            }

            function buildRedirectTarget(preferredLang) {
                // 支援 404.html 的回跳（目前專案使用 redirectPath，相鄰專案使用 spa_redirect）
                // 另外也支援 404 透過 ?p= 傳遞完整路徑，避免某些環境下 sessionStorage 取不到
                const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
                const paramPath = params.get('p');
                const saved = sessionStorage.getItem('redirectPath')
                    || sessionStorage.getItem('spa_redirect')
                    || (paramPath ? decodeURIComponent(paramPath) : '/')
                    || '/';

                let originalPath = typeof saved === 'string' && saved.length > 0 ? saved : '/';

                // 若誤傳了絕對 URL，轉回相對路徑（只保留 path + query + hash）
                try {
                    if (/^https?:/i.test(originalPath)) {
                        const u = new URL(originalPath, window.location.origin);
                        originalPath = (u.pathname || '/') + (u.search || '') + (u.hash || '');
                    }
                } catch {}

                // 標準化
                if (!originalPath.startsWith('/')) originalPath = '/' + originalPath;

                // 若原始就是根 /，直接導到 /{lang}/
                if (originalPath === '/') {
                    return `/${preferredLang}/`;
                }

                // 判斷第一段是否已是語言碼
                const parts = originalPath.split('/').filter(Boolean);
                const first = (parts[0] || '').toLowerCase();
                if (isSupportedLocale(first)) {
                    // 已含語言前綴，尊重原始路徑
                    return originalPath;
                }

                // 否則加上語言前綴
                return `/${preferredLang}${originalPath}`;
            }

            const detectedLang = detectLanguage();
            const target = buildRedirectTarget(detectedLang);

            // 保存偏好語言
            try { localStorage.setItem('seasalt-preferred-language', detectedLang); } catch {}

            // 清理暫存路徑
            try {
                sessionStorage.removeItem('redirectPath');
                sessionStorage.removeItem('spa_redirect');
            } catch {}

            // 立即重導向
            window.location.replace(target);
        })();
    </script>
    
    <!-- SEO 友好的 noscript 回退 -->
    <noscript>
        <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/en/">
    </noscript>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- 載入指示器 -->
    <div style="
        position: fixed; 
        top: 50%; 
        left: 50%; 
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        text-align: center;
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        color: #4B5563;
    ">
        <div style="
            width: 32px; 
            height: 32px; 
            border: 3px solid #E5E7EB; 
            border-top: 3px solid #3B82F6; 
            border-radius: 50%; 
            animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
            margin: 0 auto 16px;
        "></div>
        <p>Redirecting to your language...</p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.7;">正在重定向到您的語言...</p>
    </div>
    
    <style>
        @keyframes spin {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #F9FAFB;
        }
    </style>
</body>
</html>
